{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a47df74e4e9d07f03558bf84a8265e2c13ebcb0f849b2ec9b26bdac8e65f9fdb", "ja": "青羽さん、今帰りました。\nいや～、外は暑いですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐，我回来了。\n哎呀～外面真热啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "d4368e07f101b672fc874060ad783e63e36c9ff6b44885155404ddcb95780655", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5eaad64d019b96694265bb32fb7f27026f27412220c5c6648f96bac9f9bddb65", "ja": "さっき、{$P$}さん宛の\n荷物が届いたので、机の上に置いておきましたよ！", "zh": "刚才有寄给{$P$}先生的包裹送到了，我已经放在桌上了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea2b073e9087b965605a496d392a53a0364169af63a8e89214db223422bcd2dc", "ja": "荷物？　あっ、もしかして……。", "zh": "行李？啊，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "0ffe46b812a520808e8ff66263a2b41323a1601731c0a8b24b8c346399a57b99", "ja": "はい！　今度のイベントの台本だと思います。", "zh": "是的！我想应该是下次活动的剧本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d1c927e009c30380aacc431a1fdcf7250231b69d7d8b486e11b1bb1341dc380b", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n早速、確認しますね。", "zh": "谢谢！\n我这就确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "27457f0530161005aded5cddbcb2ae25e825af638f2278f87444eacf8ac8740a", "ja": "そうだ、社長にも届けないと……\nすみません、ちょっと出てきます！", "zh": "对了，还得送到社长那里……\n不好意思，我出去一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "11dbca453a75301954b5640ceba1da89acce06f0e23248d4815a552be507390a", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃ～い！　……私も、みんなが\n涼しくなるようなイベント、何か考えてみようかな？", "zh": "好的，路上小心～！……我也来想想看，有没有什么能让大家凉快下来的活动吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "74c7b9b06ca7eda92b756e9ea1aa521809cb8b9e30210058c30dd65bf58ee35f", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　今度のファンイベントの\n例の台本が届いたので、持ってきました。", "zh": "辛苦了！下次粉丝活动的那份剧本送到了，我带过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "3af999b13b5b76f9580086fd87e882bb5f9636e1ace10ae31b6b08fe66c7653d", "ja": "君か、お疲れ。\n例の台本というと、久し振りのあのユニットだね！", "zh": "是你啊，辛苦了。\n说到那个剧本，是指好久不见的那个组合吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "9c7f2125e5bc1ef45f4dc66d5b92123f1d36622a22583a1188824504fc72a559", "ja": "今回も、内容については君に一任したからね。\n私も読むのを楽しみにしていたんだよ、うんうん。", "zh": "这次内容也交给你全权决定了。\n我也一直很期待能读到呢，嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6e9d470c9efb5c85e660ac3bd73859de9892b2811ecbb952a9f6bd059c34c30b", "ja": "こちらです！", "zh": "就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "e67e5a2787e71366f13446f19d5c32c5d8ad3300299f16ab715db6ae546be1d2", "ja": "何の台本ですか？　ツアーのアクト公演は\n終わったばっかりだし……ハッ！？", "zh": "这是什么剧本？巡演的剧场公演才刚结束……哈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "227635a101593d8d89be79f88c4702f616a9d8b658ff4ff1bfc85618f1de7a97", "ja": "これはもしや、『昏き星、遠い月』の続編！？\nど、どうしてこんなところに～！？", "zh": "这难道是《昏暗之星，遥远之月》的续篇！？\n怎、怎么会在这种地方～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1ece399063aa9aa04b3d6171fbae7a5d3d0ce2fc17d4c04b4e9a42916729efc4", "ja": "はい、そうなんです！　実は今度、\n夜想令嬢のファンイベントを企画していまして……。", "zh": "是的，就是这样！其实我们正在策划夜想令嬢的粉丝活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f5e242a7b45911885ee2f08d87dcf3d4337026e6a9a3c48f8c8f2218d968ac05", "ja": "せっかくだから、朗読劇をやってみたらどうかという\n話になってね。その台本が届いたというワケだよ！", "zh": "难得有这个机会，所以就提议试着演一场朗读剧。于是剧本就送来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "0be0599e8bd2cc2f35991a8f82a9009560627068da0a0c42438fbb173ae68ea2", "ja": "観客が涙した、ダークファンタジーの続編……\n私も、続きが気になってたんですよね～。じーっ。", "zh": "令观众落泪的黑暗奇幻续集……\n我也一直很想知道后续呢～。（盯。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "63d6f0f81d78a2a5fde2959e6b9d73bc7f546bc75b534ff8aa38589b59985bd9", "ja": "ん？　……あ、もしかして先に読みたいのかね？", "zh": "嗯？……啊，难道你想先看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "83d3d8114624dfc6179bdebf16cbdbd259379052dfca316406a617f9e13bbd70", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ社長、予備の台本はたくさんあるので！\n音無さん、1冊どうぞ！", "zh": "没事的，社长，备用的剧本还有很多！\n音无小姐，给您1本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "ee4777787e1f670db0ba9f959e4cd324bf85d0906714f541ceabc3eaebde5b7a", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます……ハッ！\n待って、小鳥。今読んで本当にいいの？", "zh": "哇，谢谢您……啊！\n等等，小鸟。现在真的可以读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "39bfee7d7bfc7cb8310f0170dfd25ad07072ede55be11f719c487b70481ab725", "ja": "ここはあえて読まず、本番で最大の感動を\n味わえるように我慢するっていう手も……。", "zh": "也可以故意先不读，忍耐到正式演出时再感受最大的感动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "5e28f7514c6fc034f8b8c3468bce119c73af55113af6f06691ba6247a29b9636", "ja": "まあ、読むか読まないかは、音無君に\n決めてもらうとして……イベントの準備は順調かね？", "zh": "那么，要不要读就交给音无君决定吧……活动准备得还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9eda9a41ec1b054d682dab2069a973368a8ff4e146a31e882f6c1cfd1b5af8b7", "ja": "はい、問題なく進んでいます。台本が届いたので、\n演出についても詰められそうです。", "zh": "是的，一切都在顺利进行。剧本已经送到了，看来演出方面也能进一步敲定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "4e4aa877ed6b04d34be04c9596052bc4cc5a2a823e193538450b10a3e60d8249", "ja": "うむ！　これまで、夜想令嬢を応援してくれた\n多くのファンのためにも……。", "zh": "嗯！也是为了至今为止一直支持\n夜想令嬢的众多粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "46b1b5a231447b09ab15ab0536cc0b5ddab3e89290c9cf4983f5cef4864eb3cb", "ja": "今回のイベント、\n是非とも君の力で、成功に導いてくれたまえ！", "zh": "这次的活动，就请务必用你的力量引领我们走向成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "54ec328f96ee385191c8eeed4a85af2233208b61ecded58a3998f4f1c4f6f1d0", "ja": "はい。任せてください！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "dc3f02b7f4e2886bdcf75f3bbb88ab4c97f950fd15593f6e11d7053eba7ec803", "ja": "（さて、忙しくなるぞ。\nまずはアイドル達に、台本を渡さないとな）", "zh": "（好了，接下来要忙起来了。首先得把剧本交给偶像们才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
